# Tote staging (Vercel)

The operator tests the tote on **https://ngmi-stage.vercel.app**, not localhost alone. After any `apps/web` change, deploy that project **before** saying the work is done. Do not wait to be asked. Leave **https://ngmi.markets** (splash / `apps/landing`) alone.

`apps/web` stays gitignored. Do not add it to the public `pnpm-workspace.yaml` or commit it.

## Deploy

Sync into `/tmp/ngmi-stage` (keep `.vercel` and any `.env.local`). Workspace yaml in that tree **must** include `apps/web`. Then:

```
npx --yes vercel@latest deploy --prod --yes --cwd /tmp/ngmi-stage --scope frsr --logs
```

Project: `ngmi-stage` (`prj_CAYYd91QDAJvDJSwLDPWnGN5gfRb`), scope `frsr`. Root directory `apps/web`, framework `nextjs`, output directory auto. Do not point this project at `apps/landing` and do not Git-deploy the splash onto it.

Return the production URL when the deploy is READY.
